+Diagnostic only; this is not the positive reconstruction command.
+
+Command:
+kprove spec.k --definition proof-kompiled --spec-module FIBFIB-SPEC --claims FIBFIB-SPEC.program-correct
+
+Observed:
+No output after 60 seconds; reviewer sent SIGINT. The unified exec session exited
+130. Filtering to program-correct removes the loop-invariant circularity, so the
+prover unrolls the unbounded symbolic loop. The loop claim was separately proved
+with #Top/exit 0, then the entry claim was targeted with that already-proved
+helper marked trusted; that staged command produced #Top/exit 0. The unchanged
+all-claims command also produced #Top/exit 0.
