+- `evidence/stage5_source_inventory.log`
+- `evidence/stage5_body_sensitivity.sh`
+- `evidence/stage5_body_sensitivity.log`
+- `evidence/stage5_solution_return_b.py`
+- `evidence/stage5_solution_return_b.mpy`
+
+Stage 5 result: **PASS**.
